  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Fungus::Fungus.Say
  itemId: 151
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: The history of this club speaks for itself. We owe it to the supporters
    to do better. They've stood by Bramwick through thick and thin, and it's time
    we gave them something to be proud of.
