  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Fungus::Fungus.Say
  itemId: 373
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: Lukas has got the hunger and the attitude we're looking for. He's the
    sort of player who represents the future of Bramwick Town. We need that kind
    of energy around here.
